# Pd's inlet~ and outlet~ allocate a reblocker at creation (g_io.c:320, 688) that their free functions
# do not free: 54 bytes per signal inlet or outlet of an abstraction, per load. Upstream.
leak:vinlet_newsig
leak:voutlet_newsig
# canvas_setargs keeps the last abstraction's arguments in a static until the next call. Bounded.
leak:canvas_setargs
# Pd's [table] gives its canvas a gstub (g_canvas.c:453) that is not freed: 16 bytes per [table], per load.
leak:table_donew
